            <p class="mb-0">At this point in time there is no cost for a Yomonsni massage or development booking, and all sessions are conducted in the <a href="./sanctuary/goldcoasthinterland.html">Gold Coast Hinterland</a> Sanctuary. If you're willing to be part of the development of Yomonsni, to give your time fortnightly and provide feedback and testimonials, please fill out <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScRZdbKdghBL3nArtx7maVmYgL7OrCUC8srE5sN7rgQZ8tMWQ/viewform?usp=sf_link">this form</a> and we'll be in touch.
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">Thanks!</p>
